<title>ITALY: Olivetti, France Telecom deal seen.</title>
<headline>Olivetti, France Telecom deal seen.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom's entry into Olivetti's Infostrada fixed-line telecoms joint venture is &quot;imminent&quot;, Rome daily La Repubblica said on Friday.</p>
<p>The newspaper added that an agreement had already been reached with the French group as well as Bell Atlantic which owns 33 percent of the venture and Olivetti the rest.</p>
<p>Olivetti declined to comment on the report.</p>
</text>
